WEBVTT

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.560
Cure Moonlight.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.410
You shall be destroyed, together with the Great Heart Tree!

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:27.700
Protecting the Great Heart Tree is my mission.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.780
Gather, Flower Power!

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.320
Moon Tact!

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:35.760
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:38.830
Dark Power, gather.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.870
Dark Tact!

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.490
Precure Dark Power Fortissimo!

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:13.790
So the legendary warrior, Precure, lies defeated.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.880
With this, the Great Heart Tree shall wither,

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.600
and the world shall belong to us, the Desert Apostles!

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:27.010
The flowers have fallen, so why has the tree not yet wilted?

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:29.020
Seems your luck has run out.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.840
Even if I fall,

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:38.110
other Precure shall appear before you to protect the Great Heart Tree!

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:40.030
Dark Forte Wave!

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:49.500
Cure Moonlight!

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.500
Chypre! Coffret!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.940
Pass the Heart Perfume onto the next Precure!

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:58.380
Out of the way!

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.600
My fairies... seek out my replacement!

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.700
What's the matter, Tsubomi?

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.660
It's nothing...

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.890
That same dream again...

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:30.910
Grandma!

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:38.490
Tsubomi, welcome to Kibougahana.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:41.010
{OP}

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.180
HeartCatch

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.640
Precure!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.210
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.190
Now, all together

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.650
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.280
Within each of our chests,

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:07.950
they begin to sprout

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.620
The seeds of the heart

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:10.920
are growing

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.540
bit by bit

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.210
Red,

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:14.840
white

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.130
and yellow

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:18.880
It's because these blooming buds are

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.300
all varied colors

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:21.760
that they

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.970
shine so brightly!

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:29.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.770
with such care

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:34.480
will never wither

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:38.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.950
Now, all together

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.450
HeartCatch Precure!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.120
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:51.000
They're always right by our sides

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:51.830
So together

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.680
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.630
bloom even more!

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.130
HeartCatch

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.630
Precure!

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.590
<i>I'm Hanasaki Tsubomi.</i>

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:16.650
<i>Since my parents opened up a flower shop in Kibougahana, where my grandma lives,</i>

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:17.870
<i>we moved here.</i>

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:26.000
<i>However, I'm the easily-embarrassed, shy type...</i>

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:30.640
<i>But since I'm transferring schools, I'm going to try and change that!</i>

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.810
<i>No, not can...</i>

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:34.290
<i>I will change!</i>

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.540
<i>I found one!</i>

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:41.310
<i>A four-leaf clover!</i>

00:04:41.310 --> 00:04:43.050
<i>In flower language, it means happiness.</i>

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:47.530
<i>Four-leaf clover, please grant my wish!</i>

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.630
All right, here I go!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:08.620
I'm Going to Change<i>!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:08.620
I'm Going to Change<i>!

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:22.780
All right, before we begin, I'd like to introduce a new friend to you all.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:24.540
Hanasaki, come on in.

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:25.800
O-Okay!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.760
<i>Time to say goodbye to the old shy me!</i>

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.520
<i>I'll change! Just watch!</i>

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.730
<i>I'm going to change!</i>

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:46.400
Hanasaki, write your name on the 
board, and then introduce yourself.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.610
<i>Be brave and speak loudly...</i>

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:56.330
Hanasaki Tsubomi

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:56.410
Hanasaki Tsubomi

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.750
Hanasaki Tsubomi

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.750
Nice to m—

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:58.920
Teacher!

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:03.550
Her name is way too small to read!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.340
Hanasaki Tsubomi

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:13.180
<i>I don't think I'll be able to change, clover.</i>

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:16.180
Hanasaki, go ahead and write it again.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:24.670
You seem to be rather reserved, don't you, Hanasaki?

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:30.200
Well, introduce yourself.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:37.080
My name is Hanasaki Tsubomi, and I just transferred here today.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.360
My hobbies are tending flowers and...

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.960
Even her voice is reserved!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.230
Erika, you're talking too much.

00:06:47.230 --> 00:06:49.260
Give her a chance to speak.

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:53.730
I see... I kinda forget how loud I am.

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:56.220
Sorry about that!

00:07:03.570 --> 00:07:06.330
Hanasaki, is there anything else you'd like to say?

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:10.050
Oh, uh... It's nice to meet you all!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.200
It's nice meeting you too, Hanasaki.

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:16.160
Let's get along, okay?

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.870
Let's see, where's an empty seat...

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.040
Right here, Hanasaki!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.630
<i>Next to her?!</i>

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.190
I'm Kurumi Erika!

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:34.660
If there's anything you wanna know, just ask me!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:35.980
Okay...

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:41.440
<i>I'm really no good with girls like her...</i>

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.940
Flowers that bloom from the moonlight are beautiful,

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.650
yet flowers that bloom from the sun shine brightly...

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:52.720
Hey, Hanasaki, where did you move here from?

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.010
From Kamakura...

00:07:55.010 --> 00:07:56.830
Wait, we're in the middle of class!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.640
Kamakura? Kamakura is awesome!

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.540
So, why did you move here?

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.700
I came to live with my grandma...

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:07.010
What do your parents do, then?

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:09.280
Well, at the moment they run a flower shop...

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.470
Hanasaki! Stop talking during class!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.370
I'm sorry!

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:15.870
Tatsuya, please continue.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:28.380
Tsubomi, Ms. Tsurusaki may seem like a bit of a tomboy,

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:32.030
but she's a really nice teacher who's kind to her students.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:36.270
Kurumi, we aren't really that close, so can you stop using my first name—

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:37.620
You can call me Erika.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:39.010
Okay.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.300
You're from Kamakura?

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:45.290
I've been there three times. It's nice, isn't it?

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:46.730
Yeah.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.460
You're right next to the ocean.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.250
Yeah, it's a really nice place.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:54.720
So here's where you ran off to!

00:08:58.860 --> 00:08:59.810
Oh, fried chicken!

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.780
I'll trade you my omelette for it.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.900
I was saving that for last...

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.480
Huh? Did you say something?

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.550
No...

00:09:12.390 --> 00:09:13.840
So tasty!

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:18.340
Oh, you like to save the best for last, don'tcha, Tsubomi?

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.830
Sorry. You can have it back.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.860
It's fine. Really!

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.090
Guess so.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:29.750
Hanasaki, Erika does stuff at her own pace, so you need to be pretty blunt with her.

00:09:30.190 --> 00:09:31.160
R-Right...

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.550
What're you talking about?

00:09:32.550 --> 00:09:35.020
This is just how I work!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.560
That's why we said you do stuff at your own pace.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:38.430
Oh.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.150
Myoudou!

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:42.050
Fight! Fight!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:47.400
I'm beat...

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:48.400
What?!

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:49.980
You're all quitting?!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.150
Sorry, we're busy with cram school, so...

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.940
Wait a sec!

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:58.160
If you all quit, I'll be the only one left in the Fashion Club!

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.590
Well, we all already decided to quit...

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:01.870
Sorry.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:03.080
Wait!

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:06.360
Jeez!

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.090
What should I do?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:12.330
If I'm the only member left, this club'll be demoted to an association!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.420
Wait right there!

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:18.130
Join the Fashion Club!

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.200
You haven't joined a club yet, right?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.350
I'm begging you!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.440
Hold on a sec!

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:27.560
I was planning on joining the Gardening Club—

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:30.580
Your family runs a flower shop, right?

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:34.200
Forget about flowers while you're at school!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:35.780
Come join the Fashion Club!

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.700
It'll be fun! We're girls, after all!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:41.280
There's no way you can't be interested in fashion!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.910
I'm interested in <i>flowers</i>!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.540
Don't just go deciding things on your own!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.480
<i>She's still following me?</i>

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:23.990
<i>I'm pretty sure I said no.</i>

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:36.550
Kurumi!

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:39.170
I told you to call me Erika...

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:44.180
So, Erika, why are you following me?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:47.570
I won't join the Fashion Club no matter how many times you ask...

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:50.610
My house is that way.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.110
That so?

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.030
Huh? We're still going the same way?

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.880
This is my house!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.580
What?!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.830
Why're you so surprised?

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.250
Welcome home!

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:11.940
I'm back!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:17.350
No way! You live right next door?!

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.110
Seems that way.

00:12:21.680 --> 00:12:22.970
Nice to meet you.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.510
I'm the daughter of the shopkeepers next door...

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.100
Erika, right?

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.060
Your mother told me just now.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:31.290
Oh, she did?

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:33.310
Well, I'm in the same class as Tsubomi!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:34.990
Are you now?

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:36.710
Isn't that great, Tsubomi?

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:37.820
Y-Yeah...

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.850
I'm going to borrow Tsubomi for a bit, ma'am.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:42.010
Let's go, Tsubomi.

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:42.770
Go where?

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:43.860
To my place!

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.710
I can't believe our houses are next to each other!

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:48.790
It must be fate or something!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:49.660
It's just a coincidence!

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:54.420
Sorry, but I have some things I need to do!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:55.990
Please excuse me!

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:59.460
All right! I point-blank refused her!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.280
Maybe I really have changed...

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:04.340
Oh? You wanted to change, huh?

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:06.130
Um... I...

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.060
Why didn't you say so sooner?

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.850
I've got just the change for you!

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.810
Whaddya think? It's really fashionable, ain't it?

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:24.050
I made this dress myself.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:25.360
You can have it.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.480
Will you give it a rest already?!

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.680
Hey, what's the matter?

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:32.920
Didn't you say you wanted to change?

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:37.870
What I wanted to change was 
my personality, not my <i>clothes</i>!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:41.420
Just because I don't have any friends yet... doesn't mean you can do what you like!

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:42.880
Here, have it back!

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.270
No! I gave it to you, so it's yours!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:48.690
Tsubomi!

00:13:49.380 --> 00:13:50.560
What's with you?!

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:55.170
Just cause I was... trying to help you change...

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:58.230
That was your fault, Erika.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:13:59.730
Momo...

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.960
You speak before you think.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.030
That's a bad habit, you know?

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.040
It has nothing to do with you.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:08.950
Just leave me alone!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.080
You sure aren't honest with yourself.

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.080
<i>I'm </i>so<i> very sorry for that!</i>

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:19.290
<i>Momo's so pretty, modeling while in high 
school, and is super popular with the guys!</i>

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.630
<i>Compared to that, I'm...</i>

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.210
Arghhhhhh!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.730
<i>Did I go overboard?</i>

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:56.350
<i>I guess trying to change yourself is really difficult.</i>

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:00.800
I'm sensing the presence of a Desert Apostle!

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.630
We need to reach Cure Flower ASAP!

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:17.770
<i>Another dream about Cure Moonlight...</i>

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.050
Wow!

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.530
<i>Cure Moonlight.</i>

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:37.340
<i>The legendary warrior, Precure...</i>

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.820
<i>Why am I so hung up about it when it's just a dream?</i>

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:56.480
What?! What on earth?!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.300
We're being chased by bad people!

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:00.660
Please help us!

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:02.770
Why are the plushies talking?!

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.110
We don't have time to explain!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:09.580
What are you doing? Stop! It tickles!

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:11.980
Hey, missy.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.200
Don't suppose a couple of fairies fell around here, did they?

00:16:20.740 --> 00:16:21.500
Tch.

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:25.600
What's with her? She was kinda suspicious...

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.420
She's Sasorina.

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.460
She's one of the Desert Apostles! They're evil-doers who steal people's hearts!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.380
By the way, I'm Chypre.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:35.200
And I'm Coffret.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:38.020
I'm Hanasaki Tsubomi.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:42.690
Well then, Tsubomi, if you'd please carry us like this to Cure Flower...

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:43.850
Like <i>this</i>?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:52.900
Hey, missy, you haven't seen any fairies, have you?

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.150
Whoa! A weirdo!

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:56.110
What an insolent child.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:57.550
Oh?

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:02.830
The Flower of your Heart is wilting from your suffering...

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.960
Flower of the Heart, come forth!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:22.770
She pulled out the Flower of her Heart!

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.400
This is of no use to me.

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.320
Look at this!

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:31.840
Erika!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.030
This happened because the 
Flower of her Heart was stolen!

00:17:34.510 --> 00:17:37.630
Until you take back the Flower of her Heart from Sasorina,

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:40.040
she can't be returned to normal!

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:46.000
Excuse me! Can you give back the Flower of her Heart, please?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.810
Oh, you're the girl from before.

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.050
So you had the fairies hidden in there.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.720
Oh, that'll do <i>nicely</i>...

00:17:59.100 --> 00:18:02.820
It's your cue, Desertrian!

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.310
Doll!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:09.600
Run for it!

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:13.530
Doll! Doll doll!

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.330
Doll!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.290
We're finished!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.830
I hate you, Momo!

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:35.460
Just cause you're kinda pretty and stylish 
doesn't mean you can act so damn proud!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.460
No!

00:18:36.750 --> 00:18:39.940
Doll. Doll!

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:42.080
What's it talking about?!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:45.270
It's the screams coming from the heart of the girl whose Flower of the Heart was stolen!

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:48.450
Erika...

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:52.530
I mean, I'm trying my best too!

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:56.800
But I'll never be as pretty as Momo!

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.920
I can't help being envious!

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:01.970
These are Erika's worries?

00:19:03.340 --> 00:19:08.360
If the Flower of her Heart stays separated
 like this, it'll weaken the Great Heart Tree!

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:10.000
The Great Heart Tree?

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:12.730
You know of the Great Heart Tree?

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:15.380
It's a phrase that's appeared in my dreams countless times.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.050
Your dreams?

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.080
It can't be...

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.390
Is she...

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.350
All right, I think playtime is over.

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:26.810
Now hand over the Heart Perfume.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:30.270
The Heart Perfume belongs to the legendary Precure!

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.950
I won't hand it over to a Desert Apostle!

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:36.270
I just wanna be like Momo!

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:37.540
Erika.

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:39.440
How useless.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:43.850
Stop worrying about that stuff and go capture those fairies!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.450
It's not useless!

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:51.870
Using Erika's worries to make that monster rampage is just cruel!

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:57.840
I've had it up to here with this!

00:19:59.370 --> 00:20:01.110
Why's this happening?!

00:20:01.110 --> 00:20:04.720
The Heart Perfume is responding to Tsubomi's heart!

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:09.240
Then I shall entrust Cure Moonlight's wishes to Tsubomi!

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.770
Cure Moonlight's wishes?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.570
It's a transformation item!

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:16.530
Transformation?

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:19.410
To turn into the legendary warrior, Precure!

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.410
Precure?!

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.830
Put all your heart into the Heart Perfume!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.660
And shout, "Precure! Open My Heart!"

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:26.530
Huh?!

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.230
Just say it!

00:20:29.230 --> 00:20:31.960
I don't really get it, but whatever!

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:44.880
Go forth, Seed of the Precure!

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:50.260
Precure! Open My Heart!

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.210
P-Precure?!

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:32.100
Doll.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.750
W-What the heck is with this costume?!

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:36.890
Amazing!

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:39.200
You really are a Precure!

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:41.660
A name! You need to choose a name!

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.530
I can't really do it at the drop of a hat...

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:50.030
I've got it.

00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:53.290
I'll definitely save Erika.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:56.410
My name is...

00:21:58.410 --> 00:22:01.190
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:06.380
Cure Blossom!

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:09.970
{ED}

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.160
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:39.120
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.750
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.720
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.720
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:56.560
is about to begin!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.770
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.690
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.610
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.150
We're pretty

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.950
at full bloom!

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.070
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.120
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.660
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.920
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.920
So don't sulk

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.840
because a smile's the best!

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:30.300
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:33.510
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.390
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.850
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:45.900
<i>I'm a protagonist and I've already been petrified?!</i>

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:47.590
<i>You're a protagonist, Erika?</i>

00:23:47.590 --> 00:23:49.820
<i>Wait, I'm not? No way...</i>

00:23:49.820 --> 00:23:54.820
<i>Even if you aren't a protagonist, I'll give it my all to save you!</i>

00:23:54.820 --> 00:23:58.240
<i>Please, Flower Tact! Defeat my foes!</i>

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:01.010
<i>"Your all" is way too weak!</i>

00:24:01.010 --> 00:24:02.390
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:05.220
I'm the Weakest

00:24:02.390 --> 00:24:05.220
I'm the Weakest

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:08.220
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
